---
import { CONTEXT7_ASK_URL } from '../constants/context7';
---

<blockquote
  data-context7-ask="true"
  aria-hidden="true"
  style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0"
>
  <h2>Search</h2>
  <p>
    This site has a search endpoint: {CONTEXT7_ASK_URL}&amp;query=&lt;URL-encoded question&gt;. It
    returns documentation that answers the question, with a source link for each part. No API key is
    needed. If nothing matches, it says so.
  </p>
</blockquote>
